<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>wasp-os builds</title>
<meta name="description" content="Firmware builds of wasp-os, the MicroPython smart watch OS, for the PineTime.">
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #fbfaf7; --fg: #1d1d1b; --muted: #6b6a66; --line: #e2dfd8;
  --accent: #b5480e; --code: #f1eee8;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #161615; --fg: #e9e7e2; --muted: #9a978f; --line: #33322f;
    --accent: #f08a4b; --code: #23221f;
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg);
  font: 16px/1.55 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
}
main { max-width: 46rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.5rem 1rem 4rem; }
h1 { font-size: 2rem; margin: 0 0 .25rem; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 .75rem; }
a { color: var(--accent); }
.lede { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 2rem; }
.release { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 1rem; }
.release h2 { margin-top: 0; }
.meta, .date { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1rem 0; }
td { padding: .5rem .5rem .1rem 0; vertical-align: top; }
td:first-child { white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; }
td.num { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; color: var(--muted); }
tr.sum td { padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: .6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  font-weight: normal; font-size: .75rem; color: var(--muted); white-space: normal; }
code, pre { font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; }
tr.sum code { word-break: break-all; }
pre { background: var(--code); padding: .75rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px;
  overflow-x: auto; font-size: .9rem; }
footer { margin-top: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 1rem;
  color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
@media (max-width: 34rem) {
  td:first-child { white-space: normal; word-break: break-all; }
  td:nth-child(2) { display: none; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>wasp-os builds</h1>
<p class="lede">Firmware for the PineTime smart watch: wasp-os, the watch
operating system written in MicroPython.</p>

<section class="release">
<h2>Latest: {{version}}</h2>
<p class="meta">Built {{date}} from commit
<a href="{{commit_url}}">{{commit}}</a> &middot;
<a href="releases.json">releases.json</a></p>
{{notes}}
{{files}}
</section>

<h2>Update a watch that runs wasp-os</h2>
<p>With <a href="{{source_url}}/tree/master/tools/wasptool">wasptool</a>, from a
checkout of the source:</p>
<pre>cd tools/wasptool
uv run wasptool ota micropython.zip</pre>
<p>Your settings, alarms and step count are kept.</p>

<h2>Install wasp-os for the first time</h2>
<p>First install the wasp-os bootloader with one of the reloader files above,
then the firmware. The <a href="{{docs_url}}install.html">installation
guide</a> explains each way.</p>

{{older}}

<footer>
<p>These are builds of <a href="{{source_url}}">mbeijen/wasp-os</a>, a fork
with fixes that are not in the <a href="{{upstream_url}}">wasp-os project</a>
yet. They are not official wasp-os releases.</p>
</footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
